[center]
[size=6][b][color=#4a2810]🌿 JUNIMO JAMS[/color][/b][/size]
[size=4][i]Universal In-Game Music HUD & Media Player Hub for Stardew Valley 1.6+[/i][/size]
[/center]

[line]

[size=4][b]✨ Overview[/b][/size]
[b]Junimo Jams[/b] brings a modern, ultra-responsive, and customizable music player overlay directly into your Stardew Valley game! Whether you are harvesting crops, diving deep into the Skull Cavern, or fishing at the beach, you can control and view your real-world music playback without ever having to Alt-Tab out of the game.

Engineered with a high-performance zero-GC rendering pipeline, Junimo Jams delivers rock-solid [b]60+ FPS[/b] gameplay with zero hitching, frame drops, or micro-stutters.

[line]

[size=4][b]🎵 Key Features[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]Universal Music Player Detection:[/b] Seamlessly tracks and controls [b]Spotify[/b], [b]YouTube Music[/b] (Chrome, Firefox, Brave, Edge, Opera, etc.), [b]Apple Music[/b], [b]TIDAL[/b], [b]Deezer[/b], [b]Cider[/b], [b]VLC[/b], [b]foobar2000[/b], and many more.
[*][b]True Plug & Play (Zero Extra Setup):[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Linux / Steam Deck / Proton:[/b] Connects natively to your desktop session through direct D-Bus Unix domain sockets. No Wine hacks or extra apps required!
[*][b]Windows:[/b] Works out-of-the-box with Windows Media System and background desktop players.
[*][b]macOS:[/b] Native AppleScript & media session integration.
[/list]
[*][b]Album Cover Art & Dynamic Fallbacks:[/b] Automatically displays high-resolution cover artwork for active songs with smooth rounded corners, or falls back to an animated star icon.
[*][b]Butter-Smooth Sub-Pixel Marquee:[/b] Long song titles and artist names glide effortlessly across the screen with continuous linear 60 FPS scrolling and generous pauses at the endpoints—no jerky letter jumping!
[*][b]Interactive On-Screen Controls:[/b]
[list]
[*]Click [b]Play / Pause[/b], [b]Previous Track[/b], and [b]Next Track[/b] directly on the HUD.
[*]Live animated equalizer bars that pulse dynamically to your tunes.
[*]Slim progress bar showing real-time elapsed and total song duration.
[/list]
[*][b]10 Handcrafted Visual Themes:[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Pelican Classic:[/b] Warm authentic Stardew wood and parchment aesthetic.
[*][b]Shadcn Zinc Dark:[/b] Modern minimalist dark mode.
[*][b]Tokyo Night:[/b] Vibrant neon night vibe.
[*][b]Nord Frost:[/b] Crisp arctic blues.
[*][b]Cyberpunk Neon:[/b] Electric synthwave colors.
[*][b]Earthy Green:[/b] Organic forest moss tones.
[*][b]Midnight OLED:[/b] True deep black.
[/list]
[*][b]In-Game Customization (GMCM):[/b]
[list]
[*]Freely scale the entire HUD from [b]0.5x to 2.5x[/b] to perfectly suit 1080p, 1440p, 4K, or the handheld Steam Deck.
[*]Draggable and configurable X / Y screen coordinates.
[*]Toggle album art, controls, marquee, or equalizer.
[*]Press [b]F6[/b] anytime to bring up the in-game Music Hub menu!
[/list]
[/list]

[line]

[size=4][b]🎮 In-Game Controls[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]HUD Overlay:[/b] Appears automatically during gameplay (default position: top-left).
[*][b]Media Buttons:[/b] Left-click Previous, Play/Pause, or Next directly with your mouse.
[*][b]Music Hub Modal:[/b] Press [b]F6[/b] (configurable in settings) to open the full interactive music menu.
[*][b]GMCM Config Menu:[/b] Configure size, position, themes, and keybinds live in-game using the Generic Mod Config Menu cog icon.
[/list]

[line]

[size=4][b]📋 Requirements[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]Stardew Valley 1.6+[/b]
[*][b]SMAPI 4.1.0+[/b]
[*][b]RustedUI Framework[/b] (Required UI dependency)
[*][i]Optional:[/i] [b]Generic Mod Config Menu (GMCM)[/b] for in-game configuration UI.
[/list]

[line]

[size=4][b]📥 Installation[/b][/size]

[list=1]
[*]Install the latest version of [b]SMAPI[/b].
[*]Download and extract [b]RustedUI Framework[/b] into your [code]Stardew Valley/Mods[/code] folder.
[*]Download [b]Junimo Jams[/b] and extract the archive.
[*]Place the [code]JunimoJams[/code] folder inside your [code]Stardew Valley/Mods[/code] directory.
[*]Start the game through SMAPI and enjoy your soundtrack!
[/list]

